# first_person_nouns.voc — Words whose 1st-person verb form is spelled like the noun (choro, começo,
# olho…). Without a determiner before them they lean finite VERB → +2. Add words
# with the same noun = 1sg-verb ambiguity.
#
# Format: one term per line, lowercase; '#' starts a comment.

